{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>You shall not make with Me.</b> You shall not make likenesses of the attendants who serve before Me on high (Mekhilta)." "<b>Gods of silver.</b> He comes to warn concerning the cherubim that you make to stand with Me, that they not be of silver — for if you changed to make them of silver, they are before Me as deities." "<b>And gods of gold.</b> He comes to warn not to add to two — for if you made four, they are before Me as gods of gold (Mekhilta)." "<b>You shall not make for yourselves.</b> Do not say: I will make cherubim in synagogues and study halls the way I make them in the Sanctuary — therefore it says ״לֹא תַעֲשׂוּ לָכֶם״ (ibid.)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:22.310027966Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}